{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっぴーばれんたいん!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら今年は手作りはできなかったけど、心を込めてメッセージカード書いたってことで\nあなたに...(*・ω・*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコと一緒に入浴剤とかプレゼントしたのよー。\nそしたられなりん（市來玲奈chan）が\n「うち最近このハートのジェルみたいなの欲しくてずっと探してたのー(^^)」\nってめっちゃ喜んでくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「れなりんが喜んでくれたってブログに書くねっ」\nてれなりんに言ったら、せっちゃん（宮澤成良chan）が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「うちもすごい嬉しいよーいっぱいお風呂入るよー。」\nって言って、２人で言い争ってました(*^3^*)くるっくー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン行ったら、まさに女子校のばれんたいん状態で。\n「みんなーはいはい1個ずつ取ってー♪」\nてな感じで幸せー(*´∀｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「アイドルの手作りチョコ食べれるって幸せよねー(*・ω・*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」\nて玲香せんせい（桜井玲香chan）が言ってたよ。\nそーゆー玲香せんせいも立派なアイドルじゃないですかー♪\nチョコありがとうねっ(。・ω・。)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいこまちゃん(生駒里奈chan)と相合傘した。\nだってばれんたいんだものー♪\nひめたんが「あー雨降ってるー傘ないしー。」って気にせずに歩いてたら\n横からいこまちゃんがすっと傘を差してくれましたかっこいいねーあー(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまちゃん好きよ/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃすか(齋藤飛鳥chan)とも相合傘しました(^^)\nいいでしょー？だってばれんたいんだものっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で今日のよるごはんに、「バナナチップスinヨーグルト」食べた∩^ω^∩\nステキでしょ？美味しそうでしょ？\n美味しいのよねーみゅみゅ（若月佑美chan）!!\nプレーンヨーグルトを買います。\nさくさくバナナを買います。\n入れます。食べます。\nきゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはいっかい目が合うとなかなか反らさないの。\nいや何も考えてないけど、見入っちゃうんだよね(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは乗り物酔いとかは大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車に長い時間乗ってると酔うかなー。\nバスとか電車とか新幹線とかは大丈夫です('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはバス旅行好き？\nバスでは、後ろで友達と盛り上がる人、それとも最前で景色を楽しむ人？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バス旅行とか行ったことないー。\nバスは後ろで盛り上がるのが好き好き(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんポーズとかってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はこれといってないー('ω`)\n募集しよっかな!かわいいの思いついたら教えて下さいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう中学校は卒業式しか用がないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいやまったくそんなことっ!!!\n大好きな地元のみんなに早く会いたいですよ(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん何のジュースが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんごジュースとか好き(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スムージーだっけ？そんな感じのも好き!\n炭酸は苦手です('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海外は行ったことあるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないー。\nこりあ行きたいですこりあ♪\n遠出もしてみたいけど、飛行機怖いからなー(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがみたライブとかコンサートで印象に残ってるものってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Perfumeさんのライブ楽しかったです!\n３人のダンスは生で見るとより一層尊敬します。キレイですもん!\nＭＣのときの広島弁もほんわかしたトークも可愛い(*/ω＼*)!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは広島出身って事でやっぱり野球は広島カープのファンですか？\nってかプロ野球は好きですか？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野球...。\nごめんなさい普段はあんまり見ないですっ\nでも球団の中では一番カープに愛着わくし、応援したくなります(^^)♪\n赤ヘルじゃんっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}